-- the vestibule of EVERYONE IS HERE: the disagreements between the product as its team describes it
-- and the treaty as it stands, each a statement in the assay's own terms and the darkness it waits on.
-- a held statement seats when what it waits on arrives: the customer's word, a carrier, a reach of the
-- drawer's fragment, or a seating in the treaty's translator. read by bin/counter book.
-- the first round (2026-09-04, Abe's answers through isaac) seated six statements into the assay
-- (the_audience_hears_the_receipt_by_name, outside_the_audience_hears_no_receipt, the_sender_is_never_asked,
-- the_same_page_counts_only_within_earshot, the_payer_is_the_owner_or_the_host, edit_is_within_sight and
-- its two instances), refuted one (a member is a Membership; guests are never members; who can be asked is
-- the audience of the channel minus the sender), and left these.


-- held (waiting on: the drawer's fragment. a structural recursion over a list (samePage, total, undo) and a pair-valued reading (venueTable) are beyond it; Same page as a drawn aggregate is a sum over the requests the viewer hears, one SELECT.)
theorem the_same_page_is_a_sum (qs : List Request) (v : Nat) :
    samePage qs v = total ((qs.filter (fun q => enrolled Nat.beq q.audience v)).map tally) := sorry
-- end

-- held (waiting on: a carrier. the wedding party's day lane sees neither task list but edits the day-of sheet; lanes are a seat over pages and the assay's lanes are two lists of page numbers. a lane as a role's sub-seat.)
theorem the_day_lane_sees_no_task_list (m : Member) (h : m.dayLane = true) : sees m.role .tasks = false := sorry
-- end

-- held (waiting on: the customer, when a studio arrives. a vendor is one person, one login, one Membership (v1, Abe's recommendation): a second shooter is a second Membership with its own confirmations, day-of card, invoices, and season. the business — a thing that owns invoices and a season across several people — is a probe to add when a studio with three shooters shows up, not before.)
theorem a_business_owns_a_season (rs : List Room) (v w : Nat) (hw : w ≠ v) : seasonOwed rs v = seasonOwed rs v := sorry
-- end
